(a) array3 with literal nats:
  t0.sizes = (2,3,4), |t0| = 24
(b) a runtime-sized rank-3 array from array[\RR64\](x,y,z):
  t.sizes = (2,3,4)
(c) put, get, extents:
  t[1,2,3] = 23.0
  t[0,0,0] = 0.0
  extents  = 2 3 4
(d)(e) the overload family:
  f(3.0)                 -> rank 0
  f(aplVec(5,...))       -> rank 1, 5 elements
  f(aplMat(2,3,...))     -> rank 2, 2x3
  f(array[\RR64\](2,3,4)) -> rank 3, 2x3x4
  f(array3 literal nats) -> rank 3, 2x3x4
(f) what the runtime-built rank-3 array IS:
  it is a Rank3
  it is neither AnyVector nor AnyMatrix
(g) filling by function:
  t2[1,1,1] = 7.0, f(t2) -> rank 3, 2x2x2
